      "side": 1,
      "message": "Move the polling inside this routine by passing the status bits you want to wait on to this function.\n\nYou should also add a timeout.\n\n```\n/* Return 0 on success, non-zero on a timeout */\nint check_status(struct itecomdbgr_config *conf, uint8_t wait_mask)\n\n    do {\n        /* Read status */\n        \n    } while ((status \u0026 wait_mask) \u003d\u003d 0) \u0026\u0026 !timeout);\n    \n    return timeout;\n\n```",
